\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em; margin-left: -0.12em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> as shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-942207273b593c9ad28bfe9ccb649cd9\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/942207273b593c9ad28bfe9ccb649cd9\"></div></div></div>",
